{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00200",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.91,
      "end_seconds": 4.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thank you for staying late."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.96,
      "end_seconds": 10.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.37,
      "end_seconds": 22.15,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "Honestly, it's puffiness around the eyes in the morning, and my family pushed me to come. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.65,
      "end_seconds": 27.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "How long have you had it? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.47,
      "end_seconds": 31.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "It's been about three months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.23,
      "end_seconds": 38.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is it constant, or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.12,
      "end_seconds": 40.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.45,
      "end_seconds": 44.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you had swelling in the ankles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.35,
      "end_seconds": 47.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Yes, uh, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.97,
      "end_seconds": 55.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.38,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.5,
      "end_seconds": 60.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "It's on and off. It settles a little with raising the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.93,
      "end_seconds": 66.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.66,
      "end_seconds": 67.36,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.25,
      "end_seconds": 86.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Have you had any reduced urine output, fever or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.62,
      "end_seconds": 89.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.01,
      "end_seconds": 103.21,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.18,
      "end_seconds": 105.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.66,
      "end_seconds": 111.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.98,
      "end_seconds": 115.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Yes, peanuts, it gives me my lips swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.61,
      "end_seconds": 119.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.69,
      "end_seconds": 122.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.12,
      "end_seconds": 125.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.64,
      "end_seconds": 127.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.04,
      "end_seconds": 145.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.51,
      "end_seconds": 150.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.05,
      "end_seconds": 155.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.25,
      "end_seconds": 161.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.04,
      "end_seconds": 166.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.16,
      "end_seconds": 169.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "My mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.2,
      "end_seconds": 173.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.18,
      "end_seconds": 176.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.48,
      "end_seconds": 183.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.24,
      "end_seconds": 186.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.88,
      "end_seconds": 190.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.57,
      "end_seconds": 195.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.21,
      "end_seconds": 201.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.99,
      "end_seconds": 204.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.21,
      "end_seconds": 225.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "There's pitting swelling at both ankles, and your blood pressure is on the high side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.62,
      "end_seconds": 239.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.27,
      "end_seconds": 243.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just typing this up."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.16,
      "end_seconds": 283.0,
      "duration_seconds": 22.84,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like progression of the kidney problem. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had puffiness around the eyes in the morning for about three months, and no breathlessness or reduced urine output."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.53,
      "end_seconds": 285.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Right, yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.64,
      "end_seconds": 295.0,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "We should do a urine protein test for chronic kidney disease. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.57,
      "end_seconds": 297.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.73,
      "end_seconds": 304.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Keep an eye on salt and protein portions, a dietitian can help with the specifics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.43,
      "end_seconds": 322.71,
      "duration_seconds": 18.28,
      "text": "Right. Stay off anti-inflammatory painkillers like diclofenac or ibuprofen, they're hard on the kidneys. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.86,
      "end_seconds": 325.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Okay, um, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.86,
      "end_seconds": 339.23,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.85,
      "end_seconds": 344.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.83,
      "end_seconds": 349.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. All right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.36,
      "end_seconds": 353.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.47,
      "end_seconds": 355.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}